  "description": {
    "about": {
      "items": [
        {
          "items": [
            "About this space<br><br>Brand new luxury home in the community of Twin Palms! Walking distance to shops and restaurants of 30A Avenue, 30A, Rosemary Beach, and more!<br><br>GULF VIEWS from the rooftop terrace with PRIVATE HOT TUB, dining table, corn hole, outdoor furniture with TV and more!<br><br>6-Seater LSV, 4 beach cruiser bikes included complimentary! Plus an EV charger! Gorgeous community pool access included free with your stay.<br><br>BRAND NEW beach home with tons of space to spread out or come together! A vacation dream!<br><br>The space<br><br>Welcome to 'Serene Skies!'<br><br>HOME HIGHLIGHTS:<br>-6-Seater LSV included (these rent for ~$150/day)<br>-4 beach cruiser bikes provided complimentary<br>-Rooftop terrace with outdoor furniture and dining table, TV, living space, and HOT TUB with GULF VIEWS!!<br>-Multiple balconies<br>-Community pool great for after the beach!<br>-Brand new, open concept floor plan with designer furnishing and top-of-the-line finishes (quartz counters, stainless steel appliances, etc!)<br>-5 Bedrooms + 4 full bathrooms + 1 half bathroom<br>-Gas fireplace<br>-Free WiFi<br>-Pet friendly with approval<br><br>SLEEPING ACCOMMODATIONS: Sleeps up to 16!<br><br>First Floor:<br>-Master Bedroom 1: King bed, en-suite bathroom with dual vanities, glass shower (Sleeps 2)<br>-Second Living Area: Full-size sleeper sofa, TV, and sitting area (Sleeps 2)<br><br>Second Floor:<br>-Living room (Queen air mattress if needed) with fireplace and smart TV (Sleeps 2)<br>-Kitchen<br>-Dining room<br>-Half bathroom<br><br>Third Floor:<br>-Master Bedroom 2: King bed, en-suite bathroom with glass shower (Sleeps 2)<br>-Guest Bedroom 3: Queen bed, shared bathroom with shower/tub combination (Sleeps 2)<br>-Guest Bedroom 4: Queen bed, shared bathroom with shower/tub combination (Sleeps 2)<br>-Bunk Bedroom 5: One Twin-over-Full bunk and a Twin XL trundle, with en-suite bathroom with glass shower (Sleeps 4)<br>-Laundry room<br><br>Fourth Floor:<br>-Outdoor rooftop terrace <br>-Outdoor kitchen with built-in grill<br>-Hot tub, dining area, lounge chairs, corn hole, and Gulf views!<br><br>There is a pack n' play and air mattress available upon request.<br><br>Guest access<br><br>Spot for one car in the garage and two cars in the driveway in addition to the LSV. EV Charger available in the garage for electric car charging on the go!<br><br>Located less than a half-mile from the property, the new Highway 98 Underpass makes it easy to bike directly to Highway 30A without having to cross busy roads! This art-filled pathway, featuring vibrant murals and sculptures, is both a safe and scenic way for guests looking to explore the area!<br><br>Other things to note<br>-Pet friendly upon approval. Please inquire for non-refundable pet fee based on breed and size. <br>-Check in is 4:00 PM & check out is 10:00 AM.<br>-Smoking is strictly prohibited.<br>-All renters must be over 25 years of age, or if under age 25 must be accompanied by a parent/legal guardian.<br>-LSV is not to be driven past the town of Seagrove to the East, or to the West, or on Highway 98. Resolving any issue from the LSV battery dying because of the renters not charging it will be charged to the renters.<br>-We provide a starter set of supplies such as toilet paper, paper towels, trash bags, dishwasher + laundry pods for your stay.<br>-Damage that occurs will be collected from the renters. <br>-Southern Holiday Homes can not be held liable for any damage or injury to any persons caused by LSV, bikes, hot tub, or other amenities provided to guests.",
            "Our prices include all fees. No hidden fees."
          ],
          "title": "New! 30A w Rooftop Hot Tub w Gulf Views, LSV & Bikes Included! Pet Friendly!"
        }
      ],
      "title": "About this property"
    },
